{
  "note": "A generic c. 1990 desktop computer (system unit, CRT monitor, keyboard) dressed with the Taotie Kit; a showpiece, not a museum object. Sizes chosen (reference/crt-computer/SOURCES.md): unit 420 x 360 x 112 on 18 mm feet with a 9 mm cover; monitor housing 340 x 306 front section on a 30 mm swivel foot; bezel 344 x 310 with a 262 x 197 (4:3) opening; keyboard 404 x 152. These ratios check that the build keeps those proportions.",
